Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.11,Default,,0,0,150,,Coming up on {\i1}Punirunes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.56,0:00:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, puni puni\NPunirunes! (Rune-rune!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.65,0:00:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, pet it, take care of it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.45,0:00:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, puni puni\NPunirunes! (Rune-rune!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Let's play, Punirunes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The show is squishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Punirunes. Before we knew it, these creatures\Nbegan to inhabit the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're squishsterious and soft to the touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They all love to be squished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes they're kachi-freezy and hard too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,These are some merry, adorable puni-pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows, there could be\Na Punirune right next to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.90,0:00:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ururune and the Bouquet of Memories{\fnSegoe UI Symbol}♪{\fnAvenir LT Std 65 Medium}"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.03,0:00:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Puni School,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.15,0:00:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the school for Punirunes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.41,0:00:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What will they learn about today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.29,0:01:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Airune has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.50,0:01:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.13,0:01:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Airune snuck into Yuka's backpack\Nand went to school with her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.51,0:01:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Apparently, Yuka and her classmates\Ndrew in arts and crafts today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's a skilled Punirune artist right here—Ururune!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.49,0:01:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Time for arts and crafts with Mx. Ururune.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.54,0:01:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Rise!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.88,0:01:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Bow!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.88,0:01:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Take your seats!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's get straight to drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}First, Mx. Ururune will provide an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.36,0:02:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Observe the model and\Ndraw what you see, just like me."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.41,0:02:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Students, give it a try!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"That's easy!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can Enerune actually do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.43,0:02:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"That's very wrong!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Drawing what you see\Nis harder than it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.59,0:03:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Find something you like and draw it!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ururune thinks it will be better if everyone\Ndraws things they're interested in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.48,0:03:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Loverune decides to draw the slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.53,0:03:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Loverune's so popular...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...it built up a crowd of Punirunes\Njust while focused on sketching!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The dome has become a stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.93,0:04:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now it's time for a Loverune concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, what about your sketch?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.36,0:04:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meanwhile, Coolrune...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.87,0:04:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Coolrune loves fashion,\Nso it's drawing a stylish hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh? Where's the hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.85,0:04:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Coolrune loves fashion so much,\Nit put on the hat without even thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Airune, Enerune, and Jewelrune\Nare drawing a puni-apple tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.34,0:05:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Enerune must really want to play with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.76,0:05:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Enerune loses control and dashes\Nto join their fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mx. Ururune is sad it couldn't teach them well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.62,0:06:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"That's a beautiful drawing!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.37,0:06:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"This bouquet is why I fell in love with drawing."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I just wanted everyone else to love drawing too."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Then let's go look for it!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.65,0:07:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I think if everyone draws that bouquet,\Nthey'll fall in love too!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"This bouquet made me fall in love with drawing."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I didn't draw it well, but I had a lot of fun doing it."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"How about we all draw this today?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.22,0:08:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everyone finished their drawings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"They're all fantastic!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ururune seems very happy\Nlooking at everyone's bouquet drawings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's nothing more important\Nthan having fun while drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.85,0:09:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Looks like Mx. Ururune successfully\Ntaught them what it wanted to most.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.40,0:09:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-Pal Files!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I'll tell you about...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.74,0:09:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ururune!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.61,0:09:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ururune is a Punirune who really loves to draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's prone to tears, but very gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the Puni-Pal Squestion!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.64,0:10:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,After this, Ururune searches for something\Nto teach its joy for drawing. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.23,0:10:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,424.67)}1. Loverune
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.90,0:10:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,702)}2. A bouquet
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.23,0:10:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,963.33)}3. An apple
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.37,0:10:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,2. A bouquet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wow! Are you Angelrune's friend?\NWhat's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Devilrune, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.20,0:11:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not Angelrune's friend,\Nbut its rival?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.53,0:12:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to best it in everything?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "Angelrune's Rival Devilrune{\fnSegoe UI Symbol}♪{\fnAvenir LT Std 65 Medium}"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,"Puni" in next time!
